the Saveable is a contract.
this allows Saved.
this allows failed.

the Bigger is a contract.
this allows Saved.
this allows failed.

the Game is an actor.

this can Inner.
this's Inner does...
    that is Saveable.
    this is Saved!

this can Outer.
this's Outer does...
    that is Bigger.
    do this's Inner...
        when Saved?
            this is Saved!
        or?
            this is failed!

the App is a script.
do Game's Outer...
    or?
log "ok".
